{"id":"level-up-2026-10-02","name":"2026-10-02 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s701","en":"My maternal grandmother taught me how to make dumplings.","zh":"我的外祖母教会了我包饺子。","note":"maternal · 母亲的； 母系的 · a maternal grandmother","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s702","en":"The club voted to expel members who repeatedly damaged equipment.","zh":"俱乐部投票决定开除反复损坏设备的成员。","note":"expel · 把…开除； 驱逐 · expel a member","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s703","en":"We took shelter under a bridge during the sudden shower.","zh":"突降阵雨时，我们在桥下避雨。","note":"shelter · 掩蔽； 躲避；掩蔽，隐蔽；住所；保护 · take shelter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s704","en":"The students will examine the evidence before writing their conclusions.","zh":"学生们会先审查证据，再写出结论。","note":"examine · 检查； 调查， 研究； 测验 · examine the evidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s705","en":"Summer days are unusually long at this northern latitude.","zh":"在这个偏北的纬度，夏季白昼异常漫长。","note":"latitude · 纬度； · at this latitude","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s706","en":"Please scan the signed form and save a clear copy.","zh":"请扫描已签名的表格，保存一份清晰副本。","note":"scan · 扫描；浏览；扫描 · scan a document","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s707","en":"The association organises training sessions for local language teachers.","zh":"这个协会为当地语言教师组织培训。","note":"association · 协会 · a professional association","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s708","en":"The new booking system should eliminate most duplicate entries.","zh":"新的预订系统应该能消除大部分重复记录。","note":"eliminate · 消灭， 消除； 淘汰 · eliminate waste","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s709","en":"The café aims to send less packaging to landfill.","zh":"咖啡馆致力于减少送往垃圾填埋场的包装废弃物。","note":"landfill · 垃圾堆； 垃圾填筑地， 废渣埋填地 · send to landfill","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s710","en":"She sells handmade cards to augment her income from teaching.","zh":"她卖手工贺卡，为教学收入作补充。","note":"augment · 增加， 提高， 扩大 · augment an income","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s711","en":"The birds are easily identifiable by their bright red tails.","zh":"这些鸟凭鲜红的尾巴很容易辨认。","note":"identifiable · 可辨认的， 可识别的； 可确定的， 可证明是同一的 · easily identifiable","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s712","en":"The biology display illustrates how a baby develops in the womb.","zh":"生物展板展示了胎儿如何在子宫中发育。","note":"womb · 子宫； 发源地 · inside the womb","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s713","en":"The report examines habitat destruction along the expanding coastline road.","zh":"报告研究了扩建的滨海道路沿线的栖息地破坏情况。","note":"destruction · 破坏， 毁灭， 摧毁 · habitat destruction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s714","en":"Use a stiff brush to remove mud from your boots.","zh":"用硬刷子清除靴子上的泥。","note":"stiff · 极其， 非常；硬的，僵硬的 · a stiff brush","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s715","en":"The new market helped several small local businesses prosper.","zh":"新市场帮助几家本地小企业兴旺起来。","note":"prosper · 繁荣， 兴旺； 成功 · help businesses prosper","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s716","en":"I did not want to bother her during the rehearsal.","zh":"排练时，我不想打扰她。","note":"bother · 打扰，烦扰；烦恼，操心；麻烦， 烦扰 · bother someone","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s717","en":"The exhibition documents urban renewal in former industrial neighbourhoods.","zh":"展览记录了旧工业街区的城市更新。","note":"renewal · 更新， 恢复； 重新开始； 重建； 复兴； 续期； 重申 · urban renewal","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s718","en":"The colourful illustrations will appeal to many younger readers.","zh":"彩色插图会吸引许多年幼的读者。","note":"appeal · 呼吁；起诉，上诉；吸引；上诉， 申诉； 呼吁； 感染力， 吸引力 · appeal to readers","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s719","en":"The anatomy lesson introduced the main parts of the cardiovascular system.","zh":"解剖课介绍了心血管系统的主要组成部分。","note":"cardiovascular · 心血管的 · the cardiovascular system","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s720","en":"The boardwalk passes through a swamp filled with tall reeds.","zh":"木栈道穿过一片长满高芦苇的沼泽。","note":"swamp · 淹没； · a freshwater swamp","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s721","en":"The entrepreneur opened a repair shop using recycled furniture.","zh":"这位创业者利用回收家具开了一家修理店。","note":"entrepreneur · 企业家； 承包人 · a young entrepreneur","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s722","en":"Reliable transportation makes it easier for residents to reach the hospital.","zh":"可靠的交通让居民更容易到达医院。","note":"transportation · 运输， 运输系统， 运输工具 · public transportation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s723","en":"She plans to dedicate her weekends to restoring the garden.","zh":"她计划把周末用于修复花园。","note":"dedicate · 献 ； 题献词 · dedicate time to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s724","en":"The youngest actor will appear on stage after the interval.","zh":"最年轻的演员将在幕间休息后登台。","note":"appear · 出现， 显露， 公开露面； 出场， 问世； 仿佛， 似乎 · appear on stage","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s725","en":"The exhibition is based on extensive research in local archives.","zh":"展览以在地方档案馆开展的大量研究为基础。","note":"extensive · 广大的， 广阔的； 广泛的 · extensive research","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s726","en":"The new cycle route passes through a quiet residential area.","zh":"新的骑行路线穿过一片安静的住宅区。","note":"residential · 居住的， 住宅的； 寄宿的 · a residential area","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s727","en":"He used his fork to stab a stubborn piece of carrot.","zh":"他用叉子戳一块不好叉起的胡萝卜。","note":"stab · 刺， 戳 · stab at food","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s728","en":"The monotonous task became easier when we worked in pairs.","zh":"两人一组工作后，这项单调的任务变得更容易了。","note":"monotonous · 单调的， 无聊的 · a monotonous task","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s729","en":"Her calm explanation helped inspire confidence in the new volunteers.","zh":"她平静的解释帮助新志愿者建立了信心。","note":"inspire · 鼓舞， 激起； 给…以灵感 · inspire confidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s730","en":"The workshops allow experienced craftspeople to impart knowledge to beginners.","zh":"工作坊让经验丰富的工匠向初学者传授知识。","note":"impart · 给予， 赋予； 传授； 告知， 透露 · impart knowledge","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s731","en":"The film resulted from close collaboration between artists and scientists.","zh":"这部影片是艺术家与科学家密切合作的成果。","note":"collaboration · 合作， 协作； 勾结， 通敌 · close collaboration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s732","en":"The new form aims to reduce bureaucracy for small charities.","zh":"新表格旨在减少小型慈善机构的繁琐办事手续。","note":"bureaucracy · 官僚主义； 官僚机构 · cut bureaucracy","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s733","en":"The committee sought wider consultation to legitimize its decision.","zh":"委员会寻求更广泛的协商，以使其决定获得正当性。","note":"legitimize · 使合法； 赋予合法权利 · legitimize a decision","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s734","en":"The children explored geometry by folding paper into different shapes.","zh":"孩子们把纸折成不同形状，借此探索几何。","note":"geometry · 几何； 几何学 · basic geometry","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s735","en":"We watched the swans glide across the still lake.","zh":"我们看着天鹅滑过平静的湖面。","note":"glide · 滑行， 滑翔 · glide across water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s736","en":"The manager encouraged regular breaks to prevent overwork during the festival.","zh":"经理鼓励定期休息，以防节日期间过度劳累。","note":"overwork · 使劳累过分；对…使用过度；滥用；过重的工作； 工作过度 · avoid overwork","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s737","en":"He will devote the summer to finishing his first novel.","zh":"他将把整个夏天用于完成自己的第一部小说。","note":"devote · 将…奉献给； 致力 · devote time to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s738","en":"The studio plans to invest in better recording equipment.","zh":"工作室计划投资购买更好的录音设备。","note":"invest · 投资； 投入； 授予， 赋予 · invest in equipment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s739","en":"Can you give an approximate number of people attending?","zh":"你能给出参加人数的大致数字吗？","note":"approximate · 近似的[ə'prɒksɪm3ɪt]；近似 · an approximate figure","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s740","en":"Our project explores how children use the local playground.","zh":"我们的项目探索儿童如何使用当地的游乐场。","note":"project · 放映； 投射， 发射； 突出， 伸出； 设计， 规划；计划，方案；课题，项目；工程[prə'dʒekt] · a research project","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s741","en":"The engineer checked the bridge supports for lateral movement.","zh":"工程师检查桥梁支座是否存在侧向位移。","note":"lateral · 侧面的， 旁边的 · lateral movement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s742","en":"The port provides an important link with the agricultural hinterland.","zh":"港口为农业腹地提供了一条重要的对外通道。","note":"hinterland · 内地， 腹地， 内陆 · the rural hinterland","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s743","en":"The printer will emboss the logo on each notebook cover.","zh":"印刷商将在每本笔记本封面上压印凸起的标志。","note":"emboss · 使…凸出； 压花 · emboss a cover","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s744","en":"Uncontrolled building could imperil the birds' remaining coastal habitat.","zh":"不受控制的建设可能危及鸟类仅存的海岸栖息地。","note":"imperil · 使陷于危险， 危及 · imperil a habitat","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s745","en":"We measured the diameter of each tree at chest height.","zh":"我们在胸口高度测量了每棵树的直径。","note":"diameter · 直径 · measure the diameter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s746","en":"The camera remained stationary while the dancers moved around it.","zh":"舞者围着相机移动时，相机始终固定不动。","note":"stationary · 静止的， 不动的， 固定的； 稳定的 · remain stationary","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s747","en":"The tree's rough bark was covered with pale green lichen.","zh":"树上粗糙的树皮覆着浅绿色地衣。","note":"bark · 吠叫；犬吠声； 树皮 · rough bark","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s748","en":"The walking route forms a loop around the reservoir.","zh":"这条步行路线绕水库形成一个环线。","note":"loop · 成环， 成圈； 成环形运动；圈环；环状物；环路；循环 · a circular loop","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s749","en":"Small birds perched on the bare branches outside my window.","zh":"小鸟栖在窗外光秃秃的树枝上。","note":"bare · 赤裸的， 光秃的 · bare branches","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:s750","en":"Restoring the abandoned theatre will be a formidable challenge.","zh":"修复这座废弃剧院将是一项艰巨的挑战。","note":"formidable · 可怕的； 难以应付的， 难以克服的 · a formidable challenge","recordings":[]}],"words":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:w701","en":"maternal","zh":"母亲的； 母系的","note":"英 /mə'tɜːnl/ · 美 /mə'tɝnl/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0701-uk-915a8681355f.mp3","text":"maternal"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0701-us-e049f4526349.mp3","text":"maternal"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:w702","en":"expel","zh":"把…开除； 驱逐","note":"英 /ɪk'spel/ · 美 /ɪk'spɛl/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0702-uk-b4b2a0a0a389.mp3","text":"expel"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0702-us-f4e01c372124.mp3","text":"expel"}]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-02:w703","en":"shelter","zh":"掩蔽； 躲避；掩蔽，隐蔽；住所；保护","note":"英 /'ʃeltə(r)/ · 美 /'ʃɛltɚ/","recordings":[{"label":"词条英音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45/word-audio/0703-uk-628e7d9c2ad3.mp3","text":"shelter"},{"label":"词条美音","url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/5fe1e82100e36ff2